{"availability":"available","full":"cmv/cmv-wab-widgets","name":"cmv-wab-widgets","description":"Examples of using widgets from the ESRI WebApp Builder in CMV","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":18,"created":"2016-04-15T21:33:21Z","updated":"2026-02-15T13:28:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://cmv.github.io/cmv-wab-widgets/demo.html?config=wab","topics":["arcgis-api","arcgis-js","arcgis-js-api","cmv","cmv-widgets","esri-api","esri-javascript-api","esri-js","esri-webapp-builder","wab-widgets"],"demo":"https://cmv.github.io/cmv-wab-widgets/demo.html?config=wab","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T23:57:57.704Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T23:57:57.704Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T23:57:57.704Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:20.475Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:51.579Z","stars":9,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-04T19:20:57.558Z","stars":9,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-06T21:05:56.804Z","stars":9,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-09T01:07:16.837Z","stars":9,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-11T23:57:57.704Z","stars":9,"forks":18}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Using widgets from the Esri WebApp Builder in CMV.","Widgets created for the Esri WebApp Builder are very similar to widgets used by CMV. The primary difference between them is WAB widgets rely on the jimu.js library provided by Esri. Since both WAB and CMV widgets are based on the dojo toolkit, any WAB widget could be converted to a CMV widget removing the dependency on jimu.js. That conversion process can be simple or very involved depeding on the complexity of the widget. This repo provides a solution where no conversion is required and WAB widgets can be used directly in CMV without modification.","Another important difference between WAB and CMV is applications developed with the Esri WebApp Builder are dependent on Esri web apps hosted at ArcGIS On-line or within your own implementation of Portal for ArcGIS Server. Both ArcGis Online and Portal require subscriptions at an additional cost. No subscription is required to use the WAB widgets within CMV. Applications developed with CMV use the REST services provided by ArcGIS Server to access AGS resources."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b3ba211224d872579c967045b77873e0db91adfc1f9e9e762502490eb404533d","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:00:13.520Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T00:02:39.920Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-15T13:28:14Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Using widgets from the Esri WebApp Builder in CMV.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Both ArcGis Online and Portal require subscriptions at an additional cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"No subscription is required to use the WAB widgets within CMV.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b3ba211224d872579c967045b77873e0db91adfc1f9e9e762502490eb404533d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T00:02:39.920Z"},"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T00:02:34.693Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cmv/cmv-wab-widgets/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T00:02:39.921Z","hash":"b3ba211224d872579c967045b77873e0db91adfc1f9e9e762502490eb404533d","originalBytes":16879,"storedBytes":16879,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T17:02:52.387Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T17:02:52.387Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/86589da759f17261716ae026.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-12T08:17:42.479Z","url":"https://c